Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":166,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":47512,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1805282,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":274069,"Name":"KevinY","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274069.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1381158974,"LastPoster":{"Id":288254,"Name":"soon2bMrsTurner","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":22,"Preview":{"Id":1805282,"PostDate":1381158974,"PostContent":"Hey everyone,\u00a0 \u00a0 So i've promised my fianc\u00c3\u00a9e that I'll do everything I can to remove any stress...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kevin@youngsaye.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1381158361,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274069.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KevinY","Id":274069,"Name":"KevinY","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dd14e9f2f1d768788fa854251cd65026","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey everyone,&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;So i&#039;ve promised my fianc\u00a9e that I&#039;ll do everything I can to remove any stress possible from planning our wedding, and as such, I&#039;ve been lurking around these forums for the past week soaking up as much information as I can.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;We&#039;ve finally decided on the &#039;new&#039; Royalton Punta Cana Resort and Casino, but are planning on having our reception at Jellyfish.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;We are really excited about this, but are having trouble finding proper contact information for the wedding planner for the royalton resorts. The email on their site bounced back to me.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Would love to hear from any of you who have booked your dates at the Royalton and who you&#039;ve used as a contact to do so.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;We&#039;ll have many guests travelling from Calgary, Alberta, Canada, some from Toronto and some from Asia.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Would you recommend we get a travel agent to make the booking easier for our guests? Or should they just book the dates and their travel on their own? I&#039;m a bit torn, as their are prepackaged trips available for the Royalton from Toronto to Punta Cana, however when I search for packages from Calgary there are non available. Is this something an agent would help out with?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;This is all very new to us so any help \/ suggestions would be greatly appreciated!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Thanks so much!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1805282,"PostDate":1381158974,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey everyone,\u00a0<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>So i've promised my fianc\u00a9e that I'll do everything I can to remove any stress possible from planning our wedding, and as such, I've been lurking around these forums for the past week soaking up as much information as I can.<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>We've finally decided on the 'new' Royalton Punta Cana Resort and Casino, but are planning on having our reception at Jellyfish.<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>We are really excited about this, but are having trouble finding proper contact information for the wedding planner for the royalton resorts. The email on their site bounced back to me.<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Would love to hear from any of you who have booked your dates at the Royalton and who you've used as a contact to do so.<\/p> <p>We'll have many guests travelling from Calgary, Alberta, Canada, some from Toronto and some from Asia.\u00a0<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Would you recommend we get a travel agent to make the booking easier for our guests? Or should they just book the dates and their travel on their own? I'm a bit torn, as their are prepackaged trips available for the Royalton from Toronto to Punta Cana, however when I search for packages from Calgary there are non available. Is this something an agent would help out with?<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>This is all very new to us so any help \/ suggestions would be greatly appreciated!<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Thanks so much!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kevin@youngsaye.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1381158361,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274069.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KevinY","Id":274069,"Name":"KevinY","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.102.197.167","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fc5f201113cca2e05154b4e27c2de59a","RawContent":"@[member=\"KevinY\"] Sorry I Just saw this post here is the email address I use  weddingplanner@royaltonresorts.com . I have a travel agent that everyone is using to book.","Attachments":[],"Id":1822814,"PostDate":1388932915,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"274069\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/274069-keviny\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">KevinY<\/span><\/a> Sorry I Just saw this post here is the email address I use  weddingplanner@royaltonresorts.com . I have a travel agent that everyone is using to book. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Stewarjs2@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.102.197.167","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1385329037,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275292.jpg?_r=1387054671","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bigleap35","Id":275292,"Name":"Bigleap35","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.99.32.5","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6e33468e6eb1ad24d310de4c4b3189fd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"KevinY\"]. Im also looking at that resort. YOu can find alot of informtion in these forums. Good luck on planning and try to stay stress free.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1823364,"PostDate":1389035391,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"274069\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/274069-keviny\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">KevinY<\/span><\/a>. Im also looking at that resort. YOu can find alot of informtion in these forums. Good luck on planning and try to stay stress free.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"Soon to be Mrs. Thiam ","Email":"timairee.s.sutton@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.233.229.2","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1376225647,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272458.jpg?_r=1389190783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DWBride2015","Id":272458,"Name":"DWBride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"23.30.18.121","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"82b643a38024166d5ee266100cba18bb","RawContent":"Hi ladies!!!!\n\n\nI&#039;m looking to book this resort for my wedding as well! Do you guys recommend it? I can&#039;t seem to find many pictures of actual wedding done at this resort! :-\/","Attachments":[],"Id":1826028,"PostDate":1389740854,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi ladies!!!!<br><br>\nI'm looking to book this resort for my wedding as well! Do you guys recommend it? I can't seem to find many pictures of actual wedding done at this resort! :-\/\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janina27@live.com","IpAddress":"23.30.18.121","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389740255,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276085.jpg?_r=1389741323","PhotoWidth":118,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2bMrsClark","Id":276085,"Name":"Soon2bMrsClark","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.102.197.167","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bd2cb129010b8f1064edb97e93109de8","RawContent":"@[member=\"Soon2bMrsClark\"] congrats ! I have found a couple of pictures of weddings on the beach on what they are calling the gazebo. My profile pic is of the gazebo during the day. I will see if I copied any of the photos I found online. \n@[member=\"Soon2bMrsClark\"]\n\n\nTry doing a google search for wedding royalton punta Cana 3 or 4 pictures show up. I must say that I am a little disappointed in the wrapping of the fabric if I am charged $600 for that plus a small table and two flower arrangements. \nAlso try tripadvisor photos","Attachments":[],"Id":1826067,"PostDate":1389752760,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276085\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276085-soon2bmrsclark\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Soon2bMrsClark<\/span><\/a> congrats ! I have found a couple of pictures of weddings on the beach on what they are calling the gazebo. My profile pic is of the gazebo during the day. I will see if I copied any of the photos I found online. <br \/>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276085\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276085-soon2bmrsclark\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Soon2bMrsClark<\/span><\/a><br><br>\nTry doing a google search for wedding royalton punta Cana 3 or 4 pictures show up. I must say that I am a little disappointed in the wrapping of the fabric if I am charged $600 for that plus a small table and two flower arrangements. <br \/>Also try tripadvisor photos\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Stewarjs2@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.102.197.167","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1385329037,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275292.jpg?_r=1387054671","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bigleap35","Id":275292,"Name":"Bigleap35","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.50.193.57","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ece677f04fb01d059a6ea7e40fd18002","RawContent":"Those have to be the same pictures I&#039;ve seen. On their site they said they have 3 wedding gazebos. One of which is in the garden. Trip advisor had the best pictures. We don&#039;t want to be on the beach. I&#039;m going for the garden gazebo (if I find a picture) lol.","Attachments":[],"Id":1826074,"PostDate":1389753294,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Those have to be the same pictures I've seen. On their site they said they have 3 wedding gazebos. One of which is in the garden. Trip advisor had the best pictures. We don't want to be on the beach. I'm going for the garden gazebo (if I find a picture) lol. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janina27@live.com","IpAddress":"23.30.18.121","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389740255,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276085.jpg?_r=1389741323","PhotoWidth":118,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2bMrsClark","Id":276085,"Name":"Soon2bMrsClark","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.14.163.39","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aaa6bf28b746542847fd42843503a44a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Everyone,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m getting married at the Royalton Oct 25th 2014.&amp;nbsp; I have about 40 to 50 people coming.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m also&amp;nbsp;thinking that we will do the garden wedding because we would like more privacy.&amp;nbsp; I emailed the wedding planner for pictures of the sites today - Hopefully I hear something soon :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1826236,"PostDate":1389805780,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Everyone,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm getting married at the Royalton Oct 25th 2014.\u00a0 I have about 40 to 50 people coming.\u00a0 I'm also\u00a0thinking that we will do the garden wedding because we would like more privacy.\u00a0 I emailed the wedding planner for pictures of the sites today - Hopefully I hear something soon <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenni_lee2@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"72.14.163.39","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389804844,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"cottagegirl","Id":276105,"Name":"cottagegirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"134.53.244.52","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bb1abb76883e1f6974f058c1e1ac1a8b","RawContent":"I hope you get the pictures I asked for them on Monday.I think it has been about a month since pro pictures were taken.\n@[member=\"cottagegirl\"] what rates did they give for that size group ? I also checked out the jellyfish restaurant which is mentioned a lot on the website but it was to expensive for my small group.","Attachments":[],"Id":1826252,"PostDate":1389809012,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I hope you get the pictures I asked for them on Monday.I think it has been about a month since pro pictures were taken.<br \/>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276105\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276105-cottagegirl\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">cottagegirl<\/span><\/a> what rates did they give for that size group ? I also checked out the jellyfish restaurant which is mentioned a lot on the website but it was to expensive for my small group. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Stewarjs2@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.102.197.167","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1385329037,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275292.jpg?_r=1387054671","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bigleap35","Id":275292,"Name":"Bigleap35","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.65.239.70","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6cb7d8ce429eac53948ea519c0a84741","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m getting married at the Royalton ion May 7 this year! :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Right now our ceremony is booked on the beach, but I haven&#039;t seen pictures of the locations other than the gazebo picture on tripadvisor.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1826270,"PostDate":1389810622,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm getting married at the Royalton ion May 7 this year! <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Right now our ceremony is booked on the beach, but I haven't seen pictures of the locations other than the gazebo picture on tripadvisor.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"abbiehodder@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"192.65.239.70","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1380825806,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273981.jpg?_r=1391111427","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Potter8","Id":273981,"Name":"Potter8","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.14.163.39","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c86a97ad336af90e32f268cfe72b1298","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We bought the 30 person package for around 3000&amp;nbsp;before they changed the packages.&amp;nbsp; I havn&#039;t spoken with her about the extra cost yet because we are still getting responses from people.   What package did you &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;mailto:get@[member=\"Bigleap35\"]&#039;&gt;get&amp;nbsp;@[member=\"Bigleap35\"]&lt;\/a&gt;?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1826284,"PostDate":1389812316,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We bought the 30 person package for around 3000\u00a0before they changed the packages.\u00a0 I havn't spoken with her about the extra cost yet because we are still getting responses from people.\u00a0\u00a0 What package did you <a href='mailto:get@<a hovercard-ref=' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span itemprop=\"name\">Bigleap35<\/span><\/a>'>get\u00a0@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275292\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275292-bigleap35\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Bigleap35<\/span><\/a><\/a>?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenni_lee2@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"72.14.163.39","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389804844,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"cottagegirl","Id":276105,"Name":"cottagegirl","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"75274","Title":"Royalton Punta Cana 2014","LastPostDate":1483657112},"Pages":{"TotalItems":166,"TotalPages":17,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":160},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
