{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33667,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b350c33b66b465ef201f8a93613f99fa","RawContent":"Woohoo, just sent my confirmation in to book our wedding date at DLR for April 28, 2010! So far we have 23 people booked and about another 20 who want to book closer to the date. \n Maybe I&#039;ll see some of you ladies there! We arrive April 23rd and will probably stay for 7-10 days..\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Woot\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":760051,"PostDate":1247637935,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Woohoo, just sent my confirmation in to book our wedding date at DLR for April 28, 2010! So far we have 23 people booked and about another 20 who want to book closer to the date. <br \/> Maybe I'll see some of you ladies there! We arrive April 23rd and will probably stay for 7-10 days..<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Woot\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span><p class='bbc_center'><\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.theknot.com\/ourwedding\/AmyWalter&RoySquire\">http:\/\/www.theknot.com\/ourwedding\/AmyWalter&RoySquire<\/a><span><\/p><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10719;116\/st\/20100428\/e\/Our+Wedding+in+Paradise%21\/k\/ba76\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...ba76\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"amygirl1169@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1244355104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218196.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":71,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amygirl1169","Id":218196,"Name":"amygirl1169","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33667,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cb15e79ae6f95e64d812e93f9d0eb741","RawContent":"Hi I have been looking and there doesn&#039;t seem to be many reveiws for Dreams La Romana maybe I am missing them but we think that we deffiently want to go to Dreams but want to make sure we are making the right decision so any info would be appreicieated.","Attachments":[],"Id":761013,"PostDate":1247699565,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi I have been looking and there doesn't seem to be many reveiws for Dreams La Romana maybe I am missing them but we think that we deffiently want to go to Dreams but want to make sure we are making the right decision so any info would be appreicieated.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"david_nicole8@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1243641405,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217924.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nicole8","Id":217924,"Name":"nicole8","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33667,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eed0645d731ecc3225e40951fa5a4a1a","RawContent":"Hi Ladies,\n \n Could you please send me all the photos and wedding info (and price lists for specifics like, gazebo decoration, dinners, music, etc) that you may have gotten from the resort or come across in your research? I am waiting on group rates for Dreams La Romana from the TA. I&#039;ve contacted the WC using the email addy on the Dreams website but haven&#039;t heard back yet. Not sweating yet - it&#039;s only been a day! But I&#039;d love to get something sooner than later. I guess I&#039;m just too darn excited!\n \n Thanks!!","Attachments":[],"Id":764156,"PostDate":1247860346,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Ladies,<br \/> <br \/> Could you please send me all the photos and wedding info (and price lists for specifics like, gazebo decoration, dinners, music, etc) that you may have gotten from the resort or come across in your research? I am waiting on group rates for Dreams La Romana from the TA. I've contacted the WC using the email addy on the Dreams website but haven't heard back yet. Not sweating yet - it's only been a day! But I'd love to get something sooner than later. I guess I'm just too darn excited!<br \/> <br \/> Thanks!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmcong@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1245192836,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218504.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KPEG","Id":218504,"Name":"KPEG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33667,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aee9c04d1881ad43eda4dbf7dcaa1317","RawContent":"Hi girls! \n I am new to the forum so please excuse me if i mess up this post! \n My fiance and i are planning our wedding for April 2010 in DR. We have a tentitive date with Dreams La Romana. The resort looks gorgeous. I LOVE the gazebo! I`m just wondering if anyone can tell me if a 5pm ceremony time is too late in the day. I am worried about pictures following the ceremony and do not want to have them done in the dark. Can anyone share comments?\n Thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":768062,"PostDate":1248151378,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi girls! <br \/> I am new to the forum so please excuse me if i mess up this post! <br \/> My fiance and i are planning our wedding for April 2010 in DR. We have a tentitive date with Dreams La Romana. The resort looks gorgeous. I LOVE the gazebo! I`m just wondering if anyone can tell me if a 5pm ceremony time is too late in the day. I am worried about pictures following the ceremony and do not want to have them done in the dark. Can anyone share comments?<br \/> Thanks!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><i><strong>Melissa<\/strong><\/i><\/div><\/div>","Email":"melissa.straight@ontario.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1248119298,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219606.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":253,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MelissaApril2010","Id":219606,"Name":"MelissaApril2010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":33667,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"afb6d41703e2cfaa035d0c4d97e22f6a","RawContent":"Hey ladies, \n \n Can anyone tell me if the resort feels like a huge megomonster, or if it has a smaller, more intimate feel? This is very important to me, and since I&#039;ve never been there, maybe one of you can help&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; \n Thanks.","Attachments":[],"Id":769200,"PostDate":1248214483,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey ladies, <br \/> <br \/> Can anyone tell me if the resort feels like a huge megomonster, or if it has a smaller, more intimate feel? This is very important to me, and since I've never been there, maybe one of you can help<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> <br \/> Thanks.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong>21 people + Bride & Groom booked!!<\/strong><br><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;80\/st\/20100414\/e\/Beth+and+Jon%27s+Wedding%21\/dt\/1\/k\/8e20\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...8e20\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bholthof@connect.carleton.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1247552705,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219399.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bholthof","Id":219399,"Name":"bholthof","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33667,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dcb8be91bd07eb3f96dcd113dbebfa03","RawContent":"We are booking this week for May 1st and have the 5pm wedding booked for may 4th so hopefully it isn&#039;t too late.... Who has done a recpetion there and at what time? And where? And what worked the best?","Attachments":[],"Id":769885,"PostDate":1248236490,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We are booking this week for May 1st and have the 5pm wedding booked for may 4th so hopefully it isn't too late.... Who has done a recpetion there and at what time? And where? And what worked the best?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"david_nicole8@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1243641405,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217924.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nicole8","Id":217924,"Name":"nicole8","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33667,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ce241788041cd3cbc18e06c10c8c566b","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;MelissaApril2010&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hi girls! \n I am new to the forum so please excuse me if i mess up this post! \n My fiance and i are planning our wedding for April 2010 in DR. We have a tentitive date with Dreams La Romana. The resort looks gorgeous. I LOVE the gazebo! I`m just wondering if anyone can tell me if a 5pm ceremony time is too late in the day. I am worried about pictures following the ceremony and do not want to have them done in the dark. Can anyone share comments?\n Thanks!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Go to &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hey ladies, \n \n Can anyone tell me if the resort feels like a huge megomonster, or if it has a smaller, more intimate feel? This is very important to me, and since I&#039;ve never been there, maybe one of you can help&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; \n Thanks.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I have not been there but from the resort maps i have seen it is not huge but not small. I think the longest walk you would have would be 10 mins or so.","Attachments":[],"Id":770581,"PostDate":1248286145,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>MelissaApril2010<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hi girls! <br \/> I am new to the forum so please excuse me if i mess up this post! <br \/> My fiance and i are planning our wedding for April 2010 in DR. We have a tentitive date with Dreams La Romana. The resort looks gorgeous. I LOVE the gazebo! I`m just wondering if anyone can tell me if a 5pm ceremony time is too late in the day. I am worried about pictures following the ceremony and do not want to have them done in the dark. Can anyone share comments?<br \/> Thanks!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Go to <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hey ladies, <br \/> <br \/> Can anyone tell me if the resort feels like a huge megomonster, or if it has a smaller, more intimate feel? This is very important to me, and since I've never been there, maybe one of you can help<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> <br \/> Thanks.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I have not been there but from the resort maps i have seen it is not huge but not small. I think the longest walk you would have would be 10 mins or so.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hahawryluk@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1221069769,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211661.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dolfinluck","Id":211661,"Name":"dolfinluck","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33667,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"756ded137b36d9b974bf79685fa917f1","RawContent":"Hi Dreams LR brides! \n \n Just wanted to vent a little... I had based all of my pricing for my wedding package on the rates I received from Dreams PC because I was having trouble getting the info from the WC at DLR, but she said the packages\/prices are the same at all Dreams resorts.\n \n I was a little disappointed when we finally got the pricing from the WC and added up all of the same things... It was approx $500 more and you actually receive less (I&#039;m referring to the private reception dinner and cocktail hour).\n \n The WC&#039;s response was that the price difference was because DLR is a better, more luxurious hotel than DPC... but I&#039;ve never been to either, so I will just have to take her word for it! :s \n \n Are there any new DLR brides out there? There seems to be so few of us!","Attachments":[],"Id":781249,"PostDate":1248940158,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Dreams LR brides! <br \/> <br \/> Just wanted to vent a little... I had based all of my pricing for my wedding package on the rates I received from Dreams PC because I was having trouble getting the info from the WC at DLR, but she said the packages\/prices are the same at all Dreams resorts.<br \/> <br \/> I was a little disappointed when we finally got the pricing from the WC and added up all of the same things... It was approx $500 more and you actually receive less (I'm referring to the private reception dinner and cocktail hour).<br \/> <br \/> The WC's response was that the price difference was because DLR is a better, more luxurious hotel than DPC... but I've never been to either, so I will just have to take her word for it! :s <br \/> <br \/> Are there any new DLR brides out there? There seems to be so few of us!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span><p class='bbc_center'><\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.theknot.com\/ourwedding\/AmyWalter&RoySquire\">http:\/\/www.theknot.com\/ourwedding\/AmyWalter&RoySquire<\/a><span><\/p><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10719;116\/st\/20100428\/e\/Our+Wedding+in+Paradise%21\/k\/ba76\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...ba76\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"amygirl1169@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1244355104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218196.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":71,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amygirl1169","Id":218196,"Name":"amygirl1169","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33667,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"58dc2443ef6c486147a26d3c54d86235","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;amygirl1169&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hi Dreams LR brides! \n \n Just wanted to vent a little... I had based all of my pricing for my wedding package on the rates I received from Dreams PC because I was having trouble getting the info from the WC at DLR, but she said the packages\/prices are the same at all Dreams resorts.\n \n I was a little disappointed when we finally got the pricing from the WC and added up all of the same things... It was approx $500 more and you actually receive less (I&#039;m referring to the private reception dinner and cocktail hour).\n \n The WC&#039;s response was that the price difference was because DLR is a better, more luxurious hotel than DPC... but I&#039;ve never been to either, so I will just have to take her word for it! :s \n \n Are there any new DLR brides out there? There seems to be so few of us!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Hi Amy,\n Did she give you the 2010 rates or 2009? What are the differences if you dont mind?\n Thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":781597,"PostDate":1248978427,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>amygirl1169<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hi Dreams LR brides! <br \/> <br \/> Just wanted to vent a little... I had based all of my pricing for my wedding package on the rates I received from Dreams PC because I was having trouble getting the info from the WC at DLR, but she said the packages\/prices are the same at all Dreams resorts.<br \/> <br \/> I was a little disappointed when we finally got the pricing from the WC and added up all of the same things... It was approx $500 more and you actually receive less (I'm referring to the private reception dinner and cocktail hour).<br \/> <br \/> The WC's response was that the price difference was because DLR is a better, more luxurious hotel than DPC... but I've never been to either, so I will just have to take her word for it! :s <br \/> <br \/> Are there any new DLR brides out there? There seems to be so few of us!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Hi Amy,<br \/> Did she give you the 2010 rates or 2009? What are the differences if you dont mind?<br \/> Thanks!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hahawryluk@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1221069769,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211661.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dolfinluck","Id":211661,"Name":"dolfinluck","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33667,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"476f6af3e94ffb5f8ba72e34e2f5d7cd","RawContent":"Hi Girls,\n \n Just wondering if anyone had issues trying to reserve your date and put down the deposit. I have been trying to for over a week now and have gotten nowhere!\n \n I was so frustrated that I called long distance to the resort to find out what was going on since I provided my credit card (front and back copies) and DL already with the forms. I even called my bank the day I submitted the info to the resort to authorize the charge to go through. I was hung up on several times when I called the resort and finally emailed Tiara indicating this. 15 mins after this email, she called me to tell me that she emailed me the day before to let me know that they were having problems with my card and asked if I could submit a different one. (No way I&#039;m submitted another card! And I absolutely did not receive an email from her the day before.) So after a 10 second phone conversation, she said they would try again. I called my bank to make sure the note was on my account and it was, they even told me that the charge, converted to CDN funds, was tried but denied. The bank indicated that the resort probably manually entered in the expiry date backwards or inverted some numbers.\n \n I have not heard from Tiara at all today and am very stressed! I have no confirmation of my date and now they have all my confidential info and are saying it&#039;s not going through!\n \n Advice on this situation? Or how to stay calm??\n \n Thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":782364,"PostDate":1249006644,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Girls,<br \/> <br \/> Just wondering if anyone had issues trying to reserve your date and put down the deposit. I have been trying to for over a week now and have gotten nowhere!<br \/> <br \/> I was so frustrated that I called long distance to the resort to find out what was going on since I provided my credit card (front and back copies) and DL already with the forms. I even called my bank the day I submitted the info to the resort to authorize the charge to go through. I was hung up on several times when I called the resort and finally emailed Tiara indicating this. 15 mins after this email, she called me to tell me that she emailed me the day before to let me know that they were having problems with my card and asked if I could submit a different one. (No way I'm submitted another card! And I absolutely did not receive an email from her the day before.) So after a 10 second phone conversation, she said they would try again. I called my bank to make sure the note was on my account and it was, they even told me that the charge, converted to CDN funds, was tried but denied. The bank indicated that the resort probably manually entered in the expiry date backwards or inverted some numbers.<br \/> <br \/> I have not heard from Tiara at all today and am very stressed! I have no confirmation of my date and now they have all my confidential info and are saying it's not going through!<br \/> <br \/> Advice on this situation? Or how to stay calm??<br \/> <br \/> Thanks!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmcong@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1245192836,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218504.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KPEG","Id":218504,"Name":"KPEG","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":3935,"TotalPages":394,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":3930},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}